              "text": "<h1><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Sage Prevalon TAP 1.0</span></span></span></h1>\n<h2><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Turn and position system</span></h2>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Reduce risk factors for skin injury and patient handling injury.</span></span></p>\n",
